            "notes": "This is the spike. Congratulations, if you can hit your axe consistently, you're damn near unkillable. The only matches I've lost with this is against a stupidly good Ana.\n\nTake  [Bigger Magnet](item_c0acbb75-6f00-4736-9bb9-c144e168f511) against a  [Winston](hero_a0ebe5ef-69a6-4a8f-9360-7b7fed8bce88) or  [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6) that is constantly in the sky. Or if you're confident with your aim and there's a  [Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da) ,  [Pharah](hero_0baf7420-ff13-4b92-81f7-ca21b61dacf9)  or  [Juno](hero_035c63b7-084c-4abd-9de5-c9a00e9b6a18)  bothering you.\n\nOtherwise,  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) and  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2)  will do better and you have the greens if you've only got a few thousand left, or to replace one of the blues if you didn't get MVP",
